<title>USA: BOXING-ZARAGOZA KEEPS WBC SUPER BANTAMWEIGHT TITLE.</title>
<headline>BOXING-ZARAGOZA KEEPS WBC SUPER BANTAMWEIGHT TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1997-01-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daniel Zaragoza of Mexico retained his World Boxing Council super bantamweight title on Saturday by winning a split decision from Wayne McCullough of Ireland.</p>
</text>
